
This directory is not a Ralph project.

To fix this:
  1. Enable Ralph in existing project: ralph-enable
  2. Create a new project: ralph-setup my-project
  3. Import existing requirements: ralph-import requirements.md
  4. Navigate to an existing Ralph project directory
  5. Or create .ralph/PROMPT.md manually in this directory

Ralph projects should contain: .ralph/PROMPT.md, .ralph/fix_plan.md, .ralph/specs/, src/, etc.
